id: pm-todos-l5xl
title: "Type every importer, exporter, and preflight context without any"
description: "Replace explicit any annotations on SDK registration callbacks with the published ImportExportContext and PreflightOverrideContext contracts, update pm-changelog to 2026.7.26, and retain subprocess I/O only where the upstream importer/exporter context still lacks ctx.sdk."
type: Task
status: closed
priority: 1
tags: []
created_at: "2026-07-26T15:21:41.016Z"
updated_at: "2026-07-26T15:26:23.008Z"
